From 17ed4b4bb56ff32b97b58c6e7ce698bf22da3706 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "MOTOR-47 (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:46:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] v8: LIBC_MATH in base/ieee754.cc (FlyWeb 3.2.0,
 renderer-webgl 0003)

V8 upstream change by Nico Weber (2 Nov 2026), from softmac
FlyWeb/parches/3.2-renderer-webgl/0003, as a brave-core V8 patch: tell
LLVM's libm that V8 never reads errno or the floating-point exception
flags and always runs in round-to-nearest mode. Special inputs of the
Math functions get much faster and log, log1p, log2 and log10 about
4-7 % faster; accuracy is unaffected. Base: V8 15.6.75.66 (ieee754.cc is
not touched by any other patches/v8 file).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2hjxRPyuefYzGRoZRk
---
 patches/v8/src-base-ieee754.cc.patch | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/v8/src-base-ieee754.cc.patch

diff --git a/patches/v8/src-base-ieee754.cc.patch b/patches/v8/src-base-ieee754.cc.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..19c954ddee4473c3d6d08d3a8469ab33aed89df1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/v8/src-base-ieee754.cc.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+diff --git a/src/base/ieee754.cc b/src/base/ieee754.cc
+index bedffe01475c476b0dec39d19e3d781aea69fd58..f51591716b260111d0b3cd70f96e524100f7fcb9 100644
+--- a/src/base/ieee754.cc
++++ b/src/base/ieee754.cc
+@@ -13,6 +13,10 @@
+ // modified significantly by Google Inc.
+ // Copyright 2016 the V8 project authors. All rights reserved.
+ 
++#define LIBC_MATH                             \
++  (LIBC_MATH_NO_ERRNO | LIBC_MATH_NO_EXCEPT | \
++   LIBC_MATH_ASSUME_ROUND_NEAREST_ONLY)
++
+ #include "src/base/ieee754.h"
+ 
+ #include <cmath>
